2. CREATIVE CONTENT, ARTWORK & LORE (ALL RIGHTS RESERVED)
===============================================================================
All creative content, visual assets, and written lore contained within this 
Project are the exclusive intellectual property of Sparrow Hawk and the Hawk 
Family. They are strictly protected and MAY NOT be reproduced, distributed, 
modified, or used in any form without prior written permission.

This includes, but is not limited to:
  A. IMAGES & ARTWORK: All images in the /images/ directory, including 
     generative art, family portraits, backgrounds, and collages.
  B. WRITTEN STORIES & LORE: The narrative text inside about/about.html, 
     the "Sparrow's Creed," and all backstories.
  C. DATA & METADATA: All story text, titles, descriptions, and tags 
     contained within gallery/gallery-data.js.
  D. PERSONAS: The identities, names, and relationships of Sparrow Hawk, 
     Baby Hawk, Papa Hawk, Reyhan, Devi, Pedram, Palmer, and Gizmo.

You MAY NOT:
  - Copy, mirror, or rehost any image or written content for use on 
    other websites, portfolios, or platforms.
  - Use any artwork, writing, or character lore in AI training datasets, 
    machine learning models, or generative AI systems.
  - Mint, sell, or distribute any of these assets as NFTs or merchandise 
    (except through official links provided by Sparrow Hawk).
  - Claim authorship of any generative work, article, or character.

You MAY:
  - Link to the live website.
  - Quote short excerpts for criticism, review, or scholarship, provided 
    clear attribution and a link back to this Project are included.

